msgid "APM Planner 2.0 is the next generation of ground control station. It is the offspring of :ref:`Mission Planner <planner:home>` and `QGround Control <http://qgroundcontrol.org/>`__, combining the simple user interface of Mission Planner and cross platform capability of QGround Control."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/credits-and-contributors.rst:13
#: fbb19c10fbb24f1d9270d684df43ba4b
msgid "We offer a special thanks to `Michael Oborne <https://diydrones.com/profiles/profile/show?id=Michaelo&>`__ and his team at :ref:`Mission Planner <planner:home>` and `Lorenz Meier <https://diydrones.com/profiles/profile/show?id=LorenzMeier&>`__ and the team at `QGround Control <http://qgroundcontrol.org/credits>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/credits-and-contributors.rst:17
#: 38b35788b27c4e3aaa5317f2326d3500
msgid "APM Planner 2.0 is written in `Qt <http://www.qt.io/developers/>`__, a cross platform development environment that allows it to run on Windows, Mac, and Linux."
msgstr ""

